[('A manageable invitation','先读十五分钟吧。','Let us read for fifteen minutes first.','A short concrete invitation is easier to accept than a vague demand to work harder.'),('Protecting sleep','别太晚，明天还要早起。','Not too late; we need to get up early tomorrow.','The shared reason softens the reminder.')],
