[grammar(u,'一16','在 + place + action','Give the location of an action',
'在 introduces where an action happens: 我在车站等你. The place phrase normally comes before the action verb. Compare 我在车站, where 在 itself states location, with 我在等你, where 在 marks an ongoing action. The following word tells you which use is intended.',[
('我在车站旁边等你。','I will wait beside the station.'),('我们在这边买车票。','We buy tickets on this side.')],
('我等在车站你。','我在车站等你。','Put the location before 等 and its object 你.')),
grammar(u,'一29','subject + action + object','Build an ordinary verb-predicate sentence',
'An ordinary action sentence has a subject and a verb phrase: 我买车票. Time and place can precede the verb: 我八点在车站买票. A yes/no question may use 吗; the action does not need 是. This family concerns action predicates; adjective and nominal predicates have their own patterns.',[
('我买车票，你等朋友。','I buy tickets; you wait for our friend.'),('朋友在大学站下车。','Our friend gets off at University Station.')],
('我是买车票。','我买车票。','For a neutral statement of the action, do not insert 是 before 买. Contextual emphatic 是 has a different use.')),
grammar(u,'一44','year → month → day · hour → minutes','Read a complete appointment date and time',
'Write a date from larger units to smaller: 二零二六年十月六日. 年 is read digit by digit; 〇 in a year is líng. 日 is formal; 号 is common in speech. A weekday uses 星期 plus 一 to 六, or 日/天 for Sunday. Clock time puts 点 before minutes: 八点零五分. 半 means half past, so 八点半 is eight thirty. Use 二 in 二零二六年 but 两 in 两点.',[
('二零二六年十月六日，星期二。','Tuesday, 6 October 2026.'),('我们八点零五分见面。','Let us meet at eight oh five.'),('星期日两点半上车。','Board on Sunday at half past two.')],
('五分八点见面。','八点零五分见面。','Say the hour before the minutes.'))],
text(u,'d','Which side of the station?','Find the agreed meeting point and time.',[
('我们星期二八点在车站见面，好吗？','Shall we meet at the station on Tuesday at eight?'),('十月六号，八点零五分吧。我要先买车票。','On 6 October, at eight oh five. I need to buy a ticket first.'),
('好。你现在在什么地方？','Okay. Where are you now?'),('在车上，下一站是大学站，我在那里下车。','On the vehicle. The next stop is University Station; I will get off there.'),
('我在路上，还有五分钟。你在路口等吗？','I am on the way, another five minutes. Will you wait at the junction?'),('不，路口的马路上车多。我在车站旁边等。','No, there is heavy traffic at the junction. I will wait beside the station.'),
('是在这边还是那边？','Is it on this side or that side?'),('出口这边，旁边有商店，这个地方很好找。','On the exit side, next to a shop. This place is easy to find.'),
('我看到一辆蓝色汽车，是你的车吗？','I can see a blue car; is it yours?'),('不是。我走这条路过来，你别在马路上等。','No. I am walking along this road to you; do not wait in the road.'),
('好，我下车后先买两张车票。','Okay. After getting off, I will buy two tickets first.'),('行，我们八点半再一起上车。','Okay. We will get on together at eight thirty.')],
[('mainidea','What are they clarifying?',['The meeting point and time','A restaurant order','A school subject'],0),('detail','What time do they agree to meet?',['Eight oh five','Eight thirty','Seven fifty'],0),('inference','Why avoid waiting at the junction?',['There is heavy traffic','The shop is closed','The tickets are free'],0)],drama=True),
text(u,'r','Meeting note','Find the meeting time, the boarding time and the safe waiting place.',[
('二零二六年十月六日，星期二，我们去见朋友。','On Tuesday, 6 October 2026, we are going to meet a friend.'),
('先在大学站下车，八点零五分在车站旁边见面。','Get off at University Station first; meet beside the station at eight oh five.'),
('现在七点五十分，我在车上，朋友在路上。','It is seven fifty now. I am on the vehicle; my friend is on the way.'),
('路口的马路上车很多，不在路口等。','There are many vehicles on the road at the junction; do not wait there.'),
('出口这边有商店，我们在这个地方等。','There is a shop on the exit side; we will wait at this place.'),
('那边有一辆蓝色汽车，不是朋友的车。','There is a blue car over there; it is not our friend’s.'),
('这条路不长，走五分钟就到。','This road is short; it is five minutes on foot.'),
('我先买两张车票，八点半我们再一起上车。','I will buy two tickets first; we will get on together at eight thirty.')],
[('mainidea','What does the note explain?',['A transport meeting plan','How to wash a car','Where to study all night'],0),('detail','What happens at eight thirty?',['They board together','They first meet','The writer gets off'],0),('inference','Is the blue car their planned transport?',['No, it is not their friend’s car','Yes, it belongs to the writer','Yes, it is a taxi they booked'],0)],[(1,'零五'),(7,'上车')]),
