('我在这边。你在哪边？','I am over here. Which side are you on?'),('在车站旁边，不在路口。','Beside the station, not at the junction.'),
('那辆汽车是你的车吗？','Is that car yours?'),('不是。先下车，走到出口这边。','No. Get off first, then walk to this side of the exit.'),
